flowchart LR
    A[Substantive commit A] -->|source_revision| R[Execution proof v3]
    A --> B[Evidence-only commit B]
    R -->|first tracked in| B
    V -->|derive introduction commit| B
    B --> C[Later lifecycle metadata C]
    V[Proof validator] --> A
    V --> B
    V --> C
    V --> D[Artifact and log digests]
    V --> P{A ancestor B ancestor HEAD?}
    V --> Q{A..B changes evidence-only?}
    P -->|yes| PASS[Accept]
    Q -->|yes| PASS
    P -->|no| FAIL[Fail closed]
    Q -->|no| FAIL
